    ('L14-L14', 'property-record', 'ADV-ISSUER', 'cebb719b254d6a42b9003a4bd7fc28310a71a433b0e6242aa893dfd91f5a406c', 'transfer_shared', 'Issuer possesses registered DK and sees public outputs; unflagged tier confidentiality is computational with corresponding audit capability as an exception. Current ownership checking keys and separate issuer evidence also need exact scope. This is exact source applicability review only; current native correspondence,cryptographic assumptions and proof/runtime qualification remain open.', 'current:privacy'),
    ('L15-L15', 'property-record', 'ADV-OBSERVER', '9f084f165f0aee06f84b271951e29895ed7514c68599ca932b289efbb9944c5a', 'transfer_shared', 'The old observer sizes640-byte ciphertext/328-byte metadata are replaced by current835/272 bytes. The public view includes suite,four EPKs/c2,two65-byte ownership ciphertexts,two confirmations,detection/stream words and audit epoch; no omitted field may be assumed secret. This is exact source applicability review only; current native correspondence,cryptographic assumptions and proof/runtime qualification remain open.', 'current:privacy'),
    ('L16-L17', 'property-record', 'ADV-AUDIT-BRIDGE', '5f652f981966917a39cd5abdc2f4db38e2250b25616f057cd7f1070c9de70f5d', 'transfer_shared', 'The old audit-bridge attacker exercises disabled Orbis v0 APIs. Current legacy export/import code is absent and evidence excludes PRE packages; absence does not prove all future API rejection or broader confidentiality. Live issuer/disclosure request evidence is a separate boundary. This is exact source applicability review only; current native correspondence,cryptographic assumptions and proof/runtime qualification remain open.', 'current:disclosure'),
    ('L18-L19', 'section', 'Trust Roots', '5902d69424d65b1e60649b20b801fab9725324dbb948b050a3940ec878ee746a', 'transfer_shared', 'The trust-root heading collects external prerequisites,not circuit-derived state facts. This is exact source applicability review only; current native correspondence,cryptographic assumptions and proof/runtime qualification remain open.', 'current:state'),
    ('L20-L25', 'source-block', 'The asset-policy proof is accepted only against the current mutable asset root.', '39cbffeddeb651868c9ff2ef640d4f87be98303f13dddd75dcc2124230e440f1', 'transfer_shared', 'The old current-mutable-root-only policy is replaced by exact paired current or authorized historical user/asset snapshots under freeze epoch,age and nonfuture checks. Local membership is relative to supplied roots and does not derive state provenance. This is exact source applicability review only; current native correspondence,cryptographic assumptions and proof/runtime qualification remain open.', 'current:compliance'),
    ('L26-L31', 'source-block', 'Asset-policy admission is also a live prerequisite: both the detection key and', 'b050bd4ca6a5e0df6bf120b58f30aa5d420c27959fb72c2493b467de960c6f07', 'transfer_shared', 'Detection/ring nonidentity must be validated at source API/storage/registry boundaries before mutation. Current registered audit payload/checking keys additionally require nonzero epoch,distinctness and no sink; circuit use does not authenticate admitted policy. This is exact source applicability review only; current native correspondence,cryptographic assumptions and proof/runtime qualification remain open.', 'current:registry'),
    ('L32-L33', 'source-block', 'Transaction acceptance also trusts proof verification, timestamp freshness,', '7a06b030f562b1da034b4f730fc8d50e946cc1e63b7aececc568be9e0ed07505', 'transfer_shared', 'Proof verification,time,spend auth,transaction NF uniqueness and binding signature are external acceptance prerequisites. They must be derived through exact native body/fee/capability path,not assumed as full acceptance. This is exact source applicability review only; current native correspondence,cryptographic assumptions and proof/runtime qualification remain open.', 'current:admission'),
    ('L34-L38', 'signature', '.', '3d38eb461bede53731f6d994a5f3f96fd2f45328f86c61f3edf59b7e18e36d63', 'transfer_shared', 'This continuation lists external signature/nullifier/binding checks and says payload replacement breaks spend authorization via effect hash. Current exact effect hash,one action key and final auth hash/body normalization/fee ordering plus signature security are separate required joins; opaque signature acceptance is not injectivity. This is exact source applicability review only; current native correspondence,cryptographic assumptions and proof/runtime qualification remain open.', 'current:intent'),
    ('L39-L46', 'source-block', 'The Transfer relation itself rejects identity authorization keys and identity', '6e2477274de8856be98ba57d7fc0d8758beb2a102533e8b7eea0dee724f39854', 'transfer_shared', 'Old Decaf x!=0 ownership predicates prevent identity aliases but their quotient/native encoding is replaced. Current AK/cofactor8 nonidentity,actual diversified generator/Elligator/native address and fixed-spend source roles must prove exact Jubjub semantics; historical ownership proof cannot qualify them. This is exact source applicability review only; current native correspondence,cryptographic assumptions and proof/runtime qualification remain open.', 'current:ownership'),
    ('L47-L56', 'source-block', 'Computational privacy additionally assumes honest construction samples a fresh,', 'eb4cf3c954d063b71312c86cc0584f881d06dcee622992173ce798c393643874', 'transfer_shared', 'Fresh per-action nonce root/distinct sibling+fee construction and deterministic expansion are explicit CSPRNG privacy premises. Malicious creators can choose/reveal roots; native BTreeSet collision checks do not make this a circuit/consensus theorem. This is exact source applicability review only; current native correspondence,cryptographic assumptions and proof/runtime qualification remain open.', 'current:privacy'),
    ('L57-L62', 'source-block', 'Honest construction also rejection-samples each tier scalar until nonzero.', 'f20a9f40c439adf01033c8a9f1a657b0ad4c37907780b9ebf0e2b06e68442adf', 'transfer_shared', 'Honest native sampling rejection-loops each nonzero tier and checking scalar. Current canonical addresses are64 bytes,not48,and audit key epoch/role validation replaces the old registration layout. Nonzero scalar sampling does not prevent intentional disclosure or authenticate arbitrary registered keys. This is exact source applicability review only; current native correspondence,cryptographic assumptions and proof/runtime qualification remain open.', 'current:disclosure'),
    ('L63-L64', 'section', 'Public And Secret Inventory', '51a8cb2f9afc5a4484fcf50d0d90cc9c5757478f19d4e6e78155cc4c0f427acf', 'transfer_shared', 'The public/secret inventory heading scopes what an attacker receives; secrecy requires correct classification of every current field. This is exact source applicability review only; current native correspondence,cryptographic assumptions and proof/runtime qualification remain open.', 'current:privacy'),
    ('L65-L66', 'table-record', 'Class', 'e68f18d41054b6f3d371cddc1c92fb12ad998ab63c7b6a4f8c0bb5aa0021323b', 'transfer_shared', 'The inventory table distinguishes public transport,witness,issuer and audit secrets; class labels do not establish confidentiality or erase values. This is exact source applicability review only; current native correspondence,cryptographic assumptions and proof/runtime qualification remain open.', 'current:privacy'),
    ('L67-L67', 'table-record', 'Public statement/transport', 'c964f1f342d76603782dc51a66d76e0e32c66ef44facb102ae7c21bed6ac581f', 'transfer_shared', 'Public old detection slots and randomized per-spend keys are replaced by currentasset/salt/flag/reserved0,one action RK,ownership ciphertexts and confirmations. Transfer proof transport contains no issuer DLEQ,while current separate issuer evidence is live; neither absence proves a secure public view. This is exact source applicability review only; current native correspondence,cryptographic assumptions and proof/runtime qualification remain open.', 'current:privacy'),
    ('L68-L68', 'table-record', 'Prover witness', 'c93212cf0866f86b70f366fde31e58e27467f83d84d830e694e0615f02b88f7e', 'transfer_shared', 'Witness integrity must be derived from actual relation/source joins or named external assumptions. Fresh unpredictable per-action roots remain honest privacy premises and may not be treated as forced witness entropy. This is exact source applicability review only; current native correspondence,cryptographic assumptions and proof/runtime qualification remain open.', 'current:privacy'),
    ('L69-L69', 'table-record', 'Issuer secret', '57e51e81d623b37fc35b2b066986c4167d5fef768c02f6077f49615f573a6f5a', 'transfer_shared', 'Issuer DK is a secret premise enabling regulated detection/flagged tiers. Current decryptors require authenticated context,nonidentity/canonical data/confirmation and successful decoding; possession alone does not imply valid audit completion. This is exact source applicability review only; current native correspondence,cryptographic assumptions and proof/runtime qualification remain open.', 'current:disclosure'),
