    ('L72-L78', 'source-block', 'Confidentiality is claimed only for fresh per-action CSPRNG nonce roots and the', '8a3369fe4a689d1a6dadd536fb6ab917f92cb0289cca5e6ba14be303672024fb', 'transfer_shared', 'The confidentiality scope explicitly excludes root reuse and deliberate disclosure even for algebraically valid proofs. Preserve that honest-distribution scope without claiming universal accepted-transfer secrecy. This is exact source applicability review only; current native correspondence,cryptographic assumptions and proof/runtime qualification remain open.', 'current:privacy'),
    ('L79-L83', 'source-block', 'For unregulated assets, the fixed sink ring/DK policy preserves the circuit', '6af9ed9c9f3d05d62054abe1f2c230d718c8651b18d4dcbf5f2617d3f5458c4d', 'transfer_shared', 'Unregulated sink policy preserves shape without issuer decryptability. Regulated unflagged payload remains public and Orbis v0 disabled; current native issuer/disclosure capability routes must be scoped independently rather than inferred unavailable from that old sentence. This is exact source applicability review only; current native correspondence,cryptographic assumptions and proof/runtime qualification remain open.', 'current:disclosure'),
