    ('/proof_acceptance_surface/production_sinks/15', 'proof_acceptance_surface:production_sinks', 'SINK-HOST-CHECK-TX', '171093de0b3fe04c17e15b0f1e9d0205ed2cbeab121e95a20ebf34182403bb84', 'transfer_shared', 'The complete Host CheckTx sink requires exact proof guards through cached App delivery. Current HostExecution::check_tx requires initialized storage; check_tx_at constructs a temporary App from the selected committed snapshot,configured registry/cache/reader and NoIndex mode,then returns accepted or rejected from delivery. QueryService chooses only jointly published snapshots. Preserve capability and state freshness separately from stateless cache reuse and caller-selected snapshot source assumptions.', 'current:admission'),
