    ('/predicates/70', 'predicate', 'EXT-TRANSFER-EFFECT-HASH-COMPLIANCE-BINDING', 'ee6ff4d91208d2ff3fa08ba2e3c839fd7da0100a76cfb38b15a40bfc51840fdf', 'transfer_shared', 'The complete Transfer-only external record assumes effectHashBindsComplianceRecords and explicitly separates witness-anchor binding. Current TransferBody.effect_hash clones the full body,normalizes only anchor to the empty-tree root,and hashes exact protobuf effecting data retaining ordered ciphertext/metadata. Transaction effect_hash includes fee funding and ordered body action hashes; body/context anchor equality and proof projection bind the excluded anchor independently. Preserve canonical serialization and Blake2b computational collision resistance. A signature over this hash does not prove encryption correctness,anchor liveness or injective serialization by itself.', 'current:intent'),
